      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The kernel is organized around a small set of system concepts: agents are spawned inside app-provided context, execution emits protocol events, events are stored and read through kernel contracts, and the viewer renders those contracts with optional app plugins."
